  "hint": "Hover a part · E apart · ← → steps",
  "caption": "9 MX switches in hot-swap sockets on a 61 × 94 mm PCB, each wired to its own pin of a Raspberry Pi Pico, in a two-part printed case whose top is also the switch plate; 4 M3 screws from below clamp the PCB between the tray and the heat-set inserts in the top.",
